# Crafts, from a normal game start (docs/VISION.md §5): a raft lashed by hand at
# the shore, put in the water and stood on through the real key, driven over water
# nobody could wade, stepped off again, and left standing there; then the two
# mended crafts a bench turns out, boarded on dry land.
#   tools/tour.sh tours/crafts.tour --seed=1 --hour=11 --weather=clear:0 \
#     --give=driftwood:6,scrap:1,rag:2,hover_sled:1,walker_rig:1
# (--give brings the armful of driftwood, the one plate off a tip and the two rags
# the raft is lashed with, and the two bench-made crafts, which want a bench, iron
# and a machine's own legs: the bench is the gear package's proof, not this one's.)
coast calm
# Down to the water from where the game starts, on the real keys. Which way the
# sea lies is this seed's business; the walk is repeated until a raft could go
# in, so a shore that moves fails the tour loudly instead of quietly lying.
place spawn
wait 0.3
try 5
walk -1,1 1.6
await ride_ready 0.5
end
wait 0.4
shot 01-at-the-tideline
# A raft, made by hand out of what the tide brings and one drum off a wreck.
tap craft
await app:crafting 3
choose raft
tap use
await made 5
wait 0.4
tap pause
wait 0.4
# What a made craft is until it is put down: a bundle of spars, cord and one
# drum, in the creel, heavy enough to be most of what a person can carry.
tap inventory
wait 0.6
shot 02-the-raft-in-the-creel with app:inventory
tap inventory
wait 0.4
# `b` puts it in and steps on: the raft goes past the shallows, because a float
# wants water under it.
tap ride
await riding:raft 3
wait 0.5
shot 03-aboard-the-raft with riding:raft
# Out over water no body could wade. The open sea lies down and to the left of
# this shore (seed 1, the options in the header); the crossing itself is awaited,
# so a coast that moves fails the tour instead of quietly shooting the shallows.
walk -1,1 8
await ride_crossed 4
wait 0.3
shot 04-carried-over-deep-water with riding:raft, afloat
# Nosed back in the way it came out, and stepped off: the raft stays floating
# where it was left.
walk 1,-1 7
try 8
walk 1,-1 0.8
await step_off_ready 1
end
tap ride
await parked:raft 3
wait 0.5
shot 05-raft-left-floating with parked:raft
# The mended two, boarded on the ground they are for: a hover sled that runs the
# bog and the shallows at speed, and a rig of machine legs to stride a cliff on.
ground grass
wait 0.3
tap ride
await riding:hover_sled 3
wait 0.5
shot 06-aboard-the-sled with riding:hover_sled
tap ride
await parked:hover_sled 3
wait 0.4
shot 07-sled-parked with parked:hover_sled
walk 1,0 1.0
wait 0.3
tap ride
await riding:walker_rig 3
wait 0.5
shot 08-in-the-walker-rig with riding:walker_rig
tap ride
await parked:walker_rig 3
wait 0.5
shot 09-walker-rig-left-standing with parked:walker_rig
